# Deny by default: the build context holds the project definition, the lock and app/.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!app/

# Excluded again, after the re-includes, wherever they are.
**/.env*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.claude
data/synthetic/out
tests
# The dev login shim never ships (ADR 0009); `make docker-build` checks the image.
app/auth/dev_shim.py
